        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is a JSON formatter?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "A JSON formatter is a tool that takes raw, compact, or minified JSON text and reformats it with consistent indentation and line breaks — a process also called pretty-printing or beautifying. It makes JSON data human-readable without changing the underlying data. A JSON formatter online does this instantly in your browser with no installation required." }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How to format JSON?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "To format JSON online: 1) Paste your JSON text into the input panel of a JSON formatter online tool. 2) Choose your indentation style (2 spaces, 4 spaces, or tab). 3) Click the Format button. The tool will parse the JSON and output a neatly indented, syntax-highlighted version. You can then copy the formatted output or download it as a .json file." }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How to properly format JSON data?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Properly formatted JSON data follows these rules: all keys must be double-quoted strings; string values must use double quotes; no trailing commas after the last item in an object or array; no comments are allowed; no undefined values — only string, number, boolean, null, object, or array. Use a free JSON formatter and validator to check and fix formatting automatically." }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How to beautify JSON format?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "To beautify JSON, paste your minified or raw JSON into a pretty JSON formatter tool and click Format. The formatter runs JSON.parse() to validate the data, then JSON.stringify() with an indentation argument to produce clean, indented output with each key on its own line. This process is also called JSON pretty-printing. JSON Formatter Online does this instantly in your browser." }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How to use a JSON formatter?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Using a JSON formatter online is simple: 1) Open jsonformatteronline.in in your browser. 2) Paste your JSON into the left input panel, or click Load File to upload a .json file. 3) Select your preferred indentation (2sp, 4sp, or Tab). 4) Click ⚡ Format. The right panel shows syntax-highlighted, formatted output. 5) Click Copy or Download to save the result. Your input is automatically remembered if you switch to another tool tab." }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does a JSON formatter work?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "A JSON formatter works in two steps. First, it passes your input through a JSON parser (JSON.parse() in JavaScript) which validates the syntax and builds an in-memory data structure. If parsing fails, it reports the exact line and column of the error. Second, if parsing succeeds, it serializes the data back to a string using JSON.stringify() with an indentation parameter, producing neatly formatted output with consistent spacing and line breaks." }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What are the benefits of using a JSON formatter?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "The main benefits of using a JSON formatter are: (1) Readability — transforms dense single-line JSON into structured, indented text you can scan instantly. (2) Error detection — validates syntax and pinpoints errors with line and column numbers. (3) Debugging — makes it easy to inspect API responses, config files, and data payloads. (4) Productivity — saves time compared to manually reading minified JSON. (5) Safety — a client-side JSON formatter processes data entirely in your browser with no data sent to servers." }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the best JSON formatter online?",
          "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "The best JSON formatter online combines formatting, validation, minification, and comparison in a single free tool. JSON Formatter Online (jsonformatteronline.in) is completely free with no sign-up, processes all data in your browser for privacy, supports 8 languages, works on mobile, and persists your work across tool tabs. It includes a pretty JSON formatter, JSON validator, minifier, JSON to CSV converter, and JSON diff checker." }
        },
