            <div data-i18n="homeWhyPrivateTitle" class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold" style="color:var(--jfo-text-1)">Private by Design</div>
            <p data-i18n-html="homeWhyPrivateBody" class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--jfo-text-3)">All processing runs in your browser. This <strong>free online JSON formatter</strong> makes zero server requests — your API keys, passwords, and confidential payloads never leave your device.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border p-3" style="border-color:var(--jfo-border);background:var(--jfo-bg-soft)">
            <div data-i18n="homeWhyLangTitle" class="mb-1 text-xs font-semibold" style="color:var(--jfo-text-1)">8 Languages</div>
            <p data-i18n-html="homeWhyLangBody" class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--jfo-text-3)">Full UI in English, Spanish, French, German, Chinese, Hindi, Portuguese, and Japanese. Switch instantly from the language picker — no page reload.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider" style="color:var(--jfo-accent);font-family:ui-monospace,monospace"><span data-i18n="homeToolkitTitle">Complete JSON Toolkit — Five Free Tools</span></h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--jfo-text-2)"><span data-i18n-html="homeToolkitIntro">Beyond the core <strong style="color:var(--jfo-text-1)">online JSON formatter</strong>, this site provides four additional utilities covering the complete JSON workflow:</span></p>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm list-none" style="color:var(--jfo-text-2)">
          <li class="flex gap-2">
            <span style="color:var(--jfo-accent)">→</span>
            <span data-i18n-html="homeToolValidator"><a href="/json-validator" style="color:var(--jfo-text-1);font-weight:600">JSON Validator</a> — RFC 8259 syntax check with exact line/column errors and structural stats. Acts as a standalone <strong>json formatter and validator</strong> for deep inspection.</span>
